Package: platform-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: Platform Release Engineering <support@amrudai.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Pre-Depends: bash (>= 5), coreutils, util-linux, passwd, systemd (>= 245)
Depends: adduser
Description: Platform (AmrudAi) Linux Agent native package
 Ships the Linux Agent binary, systemd unit and packaging helpers under
 /opt/platform/agent. Fresh installs without /etc/platform/agent.env remain
 STAGED/UNCONFIGURED and do not fabricate enrollment, certificates or
 tenant/agent identity. Artifacts from this recipe are UNSIGNED/INTERNAL_ONLY
 until separate signing/release gates pass. eBPF enrichment is never enabled
 by package scripts.
